    "Codex cached input and reasoning output are subsets. Claude ordinary input, cache creation, cache reads and output are separate categories; thinking is included in output.",
    "Final cumulative session counters are used once. Coordinator, reviewers, audit tooling and report production are outside these four task totals.",
    "Billed cost is unknown. Token counts and cached reads do not establish subscription charges or money saved.",
    "Private transcripts, session identifiers and commands are not published. Hashes bind retained evidence, not independent attestation of provider execution."
  ],
